The House of Hisinjek was here before everyone else.

257
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:44,000
Mala Hisîncik?
 
The House of Hisinjek?

258
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:46,000
Mala Hisîncik.
 
The House of Hisinjek.

259
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:48,000
Eywa.
 
Yes.

260
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:49,000
