And who else was there...

261
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:51,000
Mala Hisîncik bûn...
 
It was the House of Hisinjek...

262
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:54,000
Ee... koçer bûn vira.
 
Uh... they were nomads here.

263
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:58,000
