268
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:09,000
Zinc bûn?
 
They were Zanj?

269
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:10,000
Zinc bûn.
 
They were Zanj.

270
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:15,000
