man.
 
And approximately, they also wintered here, they also stayed
here.

273
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:27,000
Eywa. Rind e.
 
I see. Good.

274
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:31,000
Xalo gundê we jî... xêr nav lê kirin Sûrkê?
 
Uncle, your village too... why did they name it Surkê?

275
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:33,000
Vira...
 
Here...

276
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:36,000
Bil esil Sûrke... Sûrkeya qedîm...
 
Originally Surkê... the ancient Surkê...

277
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:40,000
Sûrkeya qedîm... Nika vira... vê geçîtê dibêjin Sûrkê...
 
The ancient Surkê... Now here... they call this passage
Surkê...

278
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:43,000
